f-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 37% of normal in January to February and 167% in September to October. Every grid had its driest year in 1952, and grid 34632 got 50% of normal that year.</p>"}
